@startuml flyweight_memory_gain
title Flyweight - zysk pamięci: 6 wywołań, 3 unikalne flyweighty

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150

package "FlyweightFactory (cache)" {
    card "Flyweight 'A'\n---\nSymbol: 'A'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}" as FA
    card "Flyweight 'B'\n---\nSymbol: 'B'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}" as FB
    card "Flyweight 'C'\n---\nSymbol: 'C'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}" as FC
}

package "Klient - extrinsic state (per wywołanie)" {
    card "Draw #1: ref->FA, x=10, y=20, color=black" as D1
    card "Draw #2: ref->FA, x=40, y=20, color=red" as D2
    card "Draw #3: ref->FA, x=70, y=20, color=blue" as D3
    card "Draw #4: ref->FB, x=100, y=20, color=black" as D4
    card "Draw #5: ref->FA, x=130, y=20, color=green" as D5
    card "Draw #6: ref->FC, x=160, y=20, color=black" as D6
}

D1 --> FA
D2 --> FA
D3 --> FA
D5 --> FA
D4 --> FB
D6 --> FC

note bottom
Bez Flyweight: 6 obiektów x ~70B = ~420B
Z Flyweight  : 3 flyweighty x ~30B + 6 x ~20B = ~210B
Oszczędność  : ~50% (rośnie wykładniczo przy milionach obiektów)
end note

@enduml
